neutralized: invalid bytes, controls and format characters but ZWNJ and ZWJ dropped, < and > as ‹ and ›, whitespace one space; caps: title 200, saved_as 200, site 80, author 80, note 60, kind 20, about 300, passage 600, descriptions 300, entities 200, claims 300, folders 120 bytes, lists joined by " | "; listwise: one JSON line a candidate in that order, an even share of 8064 tokens less 400 of instructions, 256 of answer and the question at 3 quarter-tokens a letter, 4 a byte; pointwise: labeled lines